<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.2in"><SUP>(1)</SUP></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Primarily represents the investment in shares of Curis, Inc. The cost of acquisition was Rs.2,699. As
of September 30, 2024 and March 31, 2024, the Company has recognized an unrealized loss of Rs.2,575 and Rs.2,451, respectively, in other
comprehensive income (&ldquo;OCI&rdquo;) for the fair value changes.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.2in">For the purpose of measurement, the aforesaid investments
are classified as follows:</P>

