<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.2in"><SUP>(1)</SUP></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Impairment loss pertains to the additions made to property, plant and equipment of the Company&rsquo;s
subsidiary, Dr. Reddy&rsquo;s Laboratories Louisiana, LLC (Shreveport Cash Generating Unit (&ldquo;CGU&rdquo;)), as the recoverable amount
continues to be lower than the carrying value. For further details, refer to Note 12 of the consolidated financial statements in the Company&rsquo;s
