<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Goodwill arising on business
combinations is not amortized but is tested for impairment at least annually, or more frequently if there is any indication that the cash
generating unit to which goodwill is allocated is impaired.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&nbsp;</P>

