<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><B>21.</B></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><B>Share-based payments</B></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 22.5pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Pursuant to the special resolutions
approved by the shareholders in the Annual General Meetings held on September&nbsp;24,&nbsp;2001, on July 27, 2005, and on July 27, 2018
respectively, the Company instituted the Dr. Reddy&rsquo;s Employees Stock Option Scheme, 2002 (the &ldquo;DRL 2002 Plan&rdquo;), the
Dr. Reddy&rsquo;s Employees ADR Stock Option Scheme, 2007 (the &ldquo;DRL 2007 Plan&rdquo;), and Dr. Reddy&rsquo;s Employees Stock Option
Scheme, 2018 (the &ldquo;DRL 2018 Plan&rdquo;), respectively, each of which allows for grants of stock options to eligible employees.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><B><I>&nbsp;</I></B></P>

