<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Some of the key management personnel
of the Company are also covered under the Company&rsquo;s Gratuity Plan along with the other employees of the Company. Proportionate amounts
