<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 0.25in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.2in"><SUP>(1)</SUP></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Other assets that are not financial assets (such as receivables from statutory authorities, government
incentives receivable, prepaid expenses, advances paid and certain other receivables) of Rs.25,242 and Rs.20,598 as of September 30, 2024
and March 31, 2024, respectively, are not included.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 0.2in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.2in"><SUP>&nbsp;</SUP></P>

